  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "text": "Keep or return! Honest reviews please. I ordered this Carlton London watch from Myntra. I am thinking of returning it as I've never heard of this brand so not sure of quality after usage. Is it even worth adding to my collection?",
      "source": "Reddit",
      "source_id": "reddit_t3_1nnmnnh",
      "date": "2025-09-22",
      "confidence": 0.94,
      "tags": [
        "asking_community_reviews"
      ],
      "segment": "gen_z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Maine yeh kurta set ₹2350 mein liya tha, aur ab yeh 82% OFF ke saath sirf ₹1247 mein mil raha hai. Agar aapko pasand aa raha hai, to abhi buy kar lijiye. Aur iska full review aur try-on dekhna hai, to video ka link bhi niche diya hai.",
      "source": "YouTube",
      "source_id": "Ugz6Lk6OnRUxG4j8fet4AaABAg.AXXr4OzyrBSAXY3pD5mLKz",
      "date": "2026-06-02",
      "confidence": 0.92,
      "tags": [
        "try_on_haul_seeking"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "On Myntra, the photos of the clothes are so edited that the colour shown is wayyy different than actual. In photos, clothes look like good quality, but you receive footpath quality. I always make sure to check photos uploaded by reviewers to see real colour.",
      "source": "YouTube",
      "source_id": "UgxL5BMpnYSYLdDJik94AaABAg",
      "date": "2023-11-20",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "tags": [
        "seeking_real_photos"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aapki video ka wait rehta h Diii chahe kuch lu ya nahi pr dekhte pura hu. Mehnge hote h mere liye ye sb, student wali mjburi me hu. Ghr se limited amount milta h, pr collection mst hote h aapke, or aapki choice or voice v mst hoti hai Dii.",
      "source": "YouTube",
      "source_id": "UgxGkrGlkAI00U--a2d4AaABAg",
      "date": "2026-06-10",
      "confidence": 0.88,
